speechtext:
1.	1921-22, 30 coal tons; 1922-23 28i coal tons; 1923-24, 38 coal tons; 1924-25, 38 coal tons.
2.	1921-22, Shooner & Co., $14.80 per ton; 1922-23, D. A. Laperriere, $15.25 per ton (chestnut), $15.00 (egg); 1923-24, D. & A. Laperriere, $16.00 per ton; 1924-25, D. & A. Laperriere, $14.50 per ton.
3.	1921-22, 2S wood cords; 1922-23, 271 wood cords; 1923-24, 28 wood cords; 1924-25, accounts not yet received.
4.	1921-22, Henri Niquet, hardwood $7 per cord, Shooner & Co., slabs $3 per cord;
1922- 23, D. &. A. Laperriere, hardwood $7 per cord, Shooner & Co., slabs $2.50 per cord;
1923- 24, D. & A. Laperriere, hardwood $7 per cord, Paul Comtois, hardwood $7 per cord, Shooner & Co., slabs $4 per cord; 1924-25, to date, accounts not received.
